    y\xFCzle\u015Fmen i\xE7in bekliyor.\""
  baslikEn: "I. VIRTUE \u2014 AWAKENING & EFFORT"
  icerikEn: '"Stop searching for me inside the dark, my love... These shadows do
    not imprison me; they wait for you to face your own weight."'
  etkilesimMesafesi: 1.75
